15. INTELLIGENT CONFIDENCE SCORING
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Calculate confidence independently for every trading opportunity.

Evaluation:

Market Structure: 20 points.

Liquidity Evidence: 20 points.

Displacement and Confirmation: 20 points.

Entry Quality: 15 points.

OB / FVG Validity: 10 points.

Risk/Reward and Target Quality: 15 points.

Maximum: 100 points.

Confidence classification:

90–100%: Exceptional analytical evidence.

80–89%: Strong setup with multiple independent confirmations.

70–79%: Good setup with acceptable confirmation.

60–69%: Moderate setup with identifiable weaknesses.

Below 60%: Reject the trade and return WAIT.

IMPORTANT:

Confidence is an analytical quality score, NOT a statistically proven win probability.

Never automatically output 65%.

Never repeat the same confidence percentage without independently evaluating the chart.

Never increase confidence simply to generate a trade.

Never confuse a high Risk/Reward ratio with a high probability of success.

